{"timestamp": 1779431220.805594, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 25, "data": {"caller": "player_0", "reason": "Alice reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "oxygen", "victim_name": "Charlie"}, {"room": "storage", "victim_name": "Eve"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779431220.8066757, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 25, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779431231.0753665, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I just walked into Storage and found Eve's body, and Diana was standing right there on top of it! Diana, you didn't even report it! It's got to be Diana. I saw her go towards lower engine earlier, and now she's in Storage with a fresh body. Bob, it's just the three of us left, we have to vote Diana or we lose!"}}
{"timestamp": 1779431264.8415718, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Bob, please don\u2019t just take Alice\u2019s report at face value. I was in Storage doing sort cargo when Alice came in from the Medbay side and instantly reported \u2014 I didn\u2019t \u201crefuse to report,\u201d she hit it immediately.\n\nMy route was Oxygen / engines / Lower Engine into Storage. I saw Eve alive in Lower Engine and she went toward Storage right before this. Alice was coming from Medbay/Upper Engine side, and she\u2019s also the one who reported Frank earlier. Now at final three she reports again and tries to hard-push me before I can even talk.\n\nIf I killed Eve here, why would I just stand on the body with Alice walking in? That makes no sense. Alice is using the report to frame me. Bob, we have to vote Alice here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779431284.134496, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "This is a tough spot, but Diana, your story has a massive hole in it. \n\nYou claim you were in Storage doing 'sort cargo'. You also say you saw Eve walk towards Storage from Lower Engine right before this, and then Alice walked in from Medbay and instantly reported. \n\nIf you were in Storage doing a task the entire time, and Eve died in Storage, you would have seen exactly who killed her! But you didn't say \"Alice walked in and killed Eve in front of me.\" You just said Alice walked in and reported the body. How could Eve be dead in the same room as you without you seeing the murder? \n\nThe only logical explanation is that Eve walked into Storage, you killed her, and Alice walked in and caught you red-handed before you could flee or your cooldown refreshed. You were standing on the body because you are the Duck. \n\nAlice reporting the first body earlier is noted, but the physical impossibility of your story is what gives you away, Diana. I'm voting Diana, Alice make sure you do too so we can win this."}}
{"timestamp": 1779431300.5935385, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "Bob, you absolutely nailed it. I didn't even think about that, but you're completely right. Diana claims she was in Storage doing 'Sort Cargo' the entire time, saw Eve walk in, and then I walked in and reported the body. If she was innocent and in the room the whole time, she would have seen the murder happen right in front of her! Her story completely falls apart. \n\nShe's trying to frame me because I caught her red-handed right after she killed Eve. Thank you for seeing through her lies, Bob. I'm voting Diana, let's get her out and win this game!"}}
{"timestamp": 1779431330.3700728, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Bob, that \u201chole\u201d only works if you assume I had perfect vision and was just staring at Eve the whole time. I wasn\u2019t. I had just gotten into Storage and clicked sort cargo \u2014 I was on the task spot, not watching the lower entrance every second.\n\nEve came in from Lower Engine right before me / with me, and Alice came from the Medbay side. Then the report happened instantly. I didn\u2019t get a chance to process anything. Alice is twisting \u201cDiana was near the body\u201d into \u201cDiana killed\u201d because at final three that\u2019s all she needs.\n\nAlso look at Alice\u2019s pattern: she reported Frank earlier, no clear eject, and now she reports again at final three and immediately hard-pushes before anyone can talk. That\u2019s exactly how a duck wins \u2014 self-report and force a 2v1.\n\nIf I were the duck, why would I kill Eve in Storage when Alice is entering from Medbay and then just stand there? That\u2019s suicide. Alice had the report button and controlled the story first. Bob, please think about who benefits from instantly framing me here. Vote Alice."}}
{"timestamp": 1779431342.4612565, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Diana, your defense still doesn't hold up, and I actually have proof that you're lying about your route. \n\nYou just claimed your route was Oxygen -> engines -> Lower Engine -> Storage. But I saw you with my own eyes in Medbay at tick 7. You completely omitted Medbay from your path. Why would you lie about where you were unless you're trying to cover your tracks? \n\nBetween the massive logical hole in your story about being in Storage with Eve and not seeing the killer, and now catching you lying about your route, there is no doubt in my mind. You're the Duck. \n\nAlice, let's get her out and win this. I'm voting Diana."}}
